{"skill":{"slug":"n8n-workflow-automation","displayName":"n8n workflow automation"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1768664321187,"changelog":"Initial release of n8n-workflow-automation skill.\n\n- Designs and outputs n8n workflow JSON with robust triggers, idempotency, error handling, logging, retries, and review queues.\n- Supports both cron and webhook triggers with configurable schedules and data contracts.\n- Outputs include workflow design specs, importable n8n JSON, and runbooks (on request).\n- Features audit logging, error notification, human-in-the-loop review queues, and safeguards against silent failures.\n- Omits secrets from outputs and enforces least-privilege by design.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3977,"sha256":"b82537f81d728a19cff51137588e95211c229e5c342cf0d008cbe971f004c1d9","contentType":null},{"path":"assets/runbook-template.md","size":648,"sha256":"cd089de698b123f56e7f35fc5ad44632fe90cb7832f4fb2adf6567dbc060228f","contentType":null},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2006,"sha256":"143889bad20a0375918d37523a9113d944c5849dfd5462b7018cf759a35cb1c9","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789016604252,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"2543e1f2c47c88dcc977df919c47f9409434923d2bff51dff3f24abdaa01c0dc","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/2543e1f2c47c88dcc977df919c47f9409434923d2bff51dff3f24abdaa01c0dc","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: n8n-workflow-automation\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill is designed to generate n8n workflow JSON and a runbook. The `SKILL.md` file contains explicit and strong security instructions for the AI agent, including 'DO NOT USE WHEN… You need to bypass security controls or hide audit trails' and 'Do not include secrets in JSON; reference env vars/credential names only'. It also instructs the agent to 'STOP AND ASK THE USER if… credential strategy (env vars) is not specified, … the workflow needs privileged access not yet approved', and to 'Prefer least privilege'. These instructions actively mitigate prompt injection risks and prevent the generation of insecure or malicious outputs, aligning with a benign classification.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779159779723},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":22,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789016604252},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a transparent n8n workflow-design helper with safety-oriented instructions and no executable payloads.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Generated n8n workflows may interact with email, Drive, Sheets, databases, or APIs depending on the user's requested workflow, but the skill tells the agent to minimize scopes, avoid secrets in JSON, and use credential names or environment variables.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The package contains Markdown instructions and a Markdown runbook template only; no install script, dependency, remote fetch, or executable code was present.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are scoped to workflow design and explicitly say to ask the user before unknown destinations, missing credential strategy, or privileged access; the flagged 'bypass security' text appears in a DO NOT USE warning, not as an override.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence mechanism, background worker, tool modification, credential harvesting, or cross-session behavior is present in the artifact.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill's stated purpose is to design n8n workflow specs, optional importable JSON, and runbooks with retries, logging, idempotency, and review queues; the capabilities described fit that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, treat generated workflow JSON as a draft: review the n8n nodes, credential references, API scopes, write targets, schedules, and retry behavior before importing or activating it. Do not paste secrets into generated workflow files.","findings":"[P1] expected: SkillSpector flagged 'bypass security' as possible instruction override, but artifact inspection shows it is part of a 'DO NOT USE WHEN' list telling users not to use the skill to bypass security controls or hide audit trails.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789016604252}}}}}